# 📚 TOEIC Vocabulary - Day28

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| accommodate | 수용하다, 편의를 제공하다 | The hotel can accommodate 200 guests. |
| reserve | 예약하다, 비축하다 | I reserved a table for two. |
| available | 이용 가능한 | The room is available next week. |
| vacant | 비어 있는 | There are no vacant rooms. |
| convenient | 편리한 | The location is very convenient. |

